    "short_description": "Historic NYC chapel with stunning architecture.",
    "long_description": "St. Paul's Chapel, located at 1160 Amsterdam Avenue in New York, is a historic chapel that has been a tranquil oasis in the bustling city since 1903. This stunning example of Gothic Revival architecture boasts breathtaking stained-glass windows, intricate stone carvings, and a peaceful atmosphere that invites reflection and contemplation. As a hidden gem on the Columbia University campus, St. Paul's Chapel awaits discovery, offering a serene escape from the city's chaos and a chance to connect with its rich history and beauty.",
