    "long_description": "The School of International and Public Affairs (SIPA) at Columbia University, located at 420 West 118th Street, New York, is a premier institution for exploring global issues and developing innovative solutions. With a diverse range of academic programs and research centers, SIPA offers students a unique opportunity to engage with renowned faculty and practitioners in the fields of international relations, public policy, and global governance. By studying at SIPA, students can gain the knowledge, skills, and network to become leaders in addressing the world's most pressing challenges and creating a more just and equitable world.",
